{"articleNo":"231963","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=231963&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] 전산서비스 만족도 설문조사 실시안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.12.02","hit":"5412","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">정보전산원에서 운영 중인 전산서비스에 대하여 만족도 설문조사를 다음과 같이 실시하오니</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">많은 참여 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">​</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">목적 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전산서비스 이용에 대한 만족도 및 요구사항을 평가 분석하여 이용자들의 의견을</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">최대한 반영하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">향후 전산시스템 서비스를 개선하여 더욱 발전시키기 위함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">​</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교직원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동문 등 전산서비스 이용자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">​</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 2019. 12. 2.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) ~ 12. 17.(화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) 18</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">​</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">홈페이지 배너를 이용한 온라인 참여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">아래 주소 클릭</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://ksite.kumoh.ac.kr/ksite/etc_survey_cic.html\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(58, 50, 195); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0p